=== SELECT cat, COUNT(*), SUM(val) FROM t GROUP BY cat ORDER BY cat
PLAN: Map(StreamingAgg(keys=[_current.CAT#1], InMemorySort([_current.CAT#1 ASC], Scan(T))), {CAT: _current.CAT#0, _1: _current.COUNT(*)#1, _2: _current.SUM(VAL)#2})
ROWS(3) cols=[CAT, _1, _2]:
