=== SELECT id, val FROM t WHERE val > 150 ORDER BY id
PLAN: Map(InMemorySort([_current.ID#0 ASC], IndexScan(IDX_VAL, [<>])), {ID: _current.ID#0, VAL: _current.VAL#2})
ROWS(3) cols=[ID, VAL]:
