=== SELECT id, val FROM t ORDER BY val, id LIMIT 4
PLAN: Limit(4, Map(InMemorySort([_current.VAL#2 ASC, _current.ID#0 ASC], Scan(T)), {ID: _current.ID#0, VAL: _current.VAL#2}))
ROWS(4) cols=[ID, VAL]:
